#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617720"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617824"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617960"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618004"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618144"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618264"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618364"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618556"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618620"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618700"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618816"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618944"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618988"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619116"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619244"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619352"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619440"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619532"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619680"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619764"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619896"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619996"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620156"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620284"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620376"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620508"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620608"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620816"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620940"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621072"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621164"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621288"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621368"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621472"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621560"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "621680"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "621764"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "621844"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "621912"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "621952"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "621984"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622016"
msgid "I touch something which sends my\nconsciousness pointing backwards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622084"
msgid "As if looking at events from tens of thousands of years ago.\nI was seeing#RUBS     forward#RUBE the future#REND before,\nbut my perspective physically changed.\nNow I'm seeing#RUBS   backwards#RUBE the past#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622296"
msgid "If I was to wear anything, I figured a black\ncoat would look nice. With it, I could turn into\nsomeone different than who I was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622424"
msgid "Humans are irrational.\nThe more you get to know them,\nthe more frightening they become."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622512"
msgid "The human malignancy preserved by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nis more repulsive than anything\nelse in this universe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622632"
msgid "It scares me. It scares me. It scares me.\nThis planet must be mad to produce\nsuch creatures."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622728"
msgid "However,\nI must take up these frightening beings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622780"
msgid "Even if that malignancy comes to taints my\nlimbs. Even if I become someone different than\nwho I was. If I'm to grant #[him][her]# a tomorrow…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622924"
msgid "Yes. I will use the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF;\nthe imaginary domain within the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623044"
msgid "If I use the Imaginary Number Space\nwhere human malignancy is trapped away,\nI should be able to pull this off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623156"
msgid "Ahh, still, it scares me.\nI'm scared, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623204"
msgid "You said you would turn nothing into something.\nThis is the only future I could create for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623300"
msgid "I'm about to destroy countless things.\nI shall become the insect that\nscorches the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623392"
msgid "I've completely changed. Please detest me.\nI've completely changed. Please loathe me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623480"
msgid "In exchange―――\nNo matter how ugly I become,\nplease don't change. Not you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623560"
msgid "―――Yes. Let's create the #C000246204Far Side of the\nMoon#CDEF. A place no one can find. An eternal\ncradle unknown to even the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623716"
msgid "These quasi-Spiritrons dumped into the Imaginary\nNumber Space; this human malignancy preserved by\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF―this shall be my power source."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623876"
msgid "With all these mental resources, I can\ndo anything. Corrupt the Moon; take over\nthe Earth; nothing is impossible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623992"
msgid "Human malice is infinite magical energy; fuel to\ngrant a wish. The inexhaustible #RUBS       Art Graph#RUBEHoly Grail Loom#REND\nof #RUBS          Heaven's Feel#RUBEthe third blasphemy#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624184"
msgid "Now, let's corrupt everything.\nLet's lock you away in a present without future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624264"
msgid "…that was a moment from a certain girl's experiences."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624320"
msgid "…it must be the effect of the flow of time accelerating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624380"
msgid "Within the span of a drawn-out second, I\nseem to have gotten a glance of the first wish\nthat was made in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "624528"
msgid "Return to the previous floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "624560"
msgid "Return to previous floor."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "624588"
msgid "Return to the old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624616"
msgid "I'd go on ahead even if #C236196003#SVT#CDEF wasn't with me.\nFor #C236196003Sakura#CDEF… no, for all of those girls' sakes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624744"
msgid "\n\n\n\nUpon coming into contact with the mist,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF enters an out-of-body state."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624848"
msgid "My consciousness gets rewired to an objective channel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624904"
msgid "These are someone else's memories.\nThese are someone else's thoughts.\nThese are past events―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625000"
msgid "Which transpire before my eyes as a vision."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625044"
msgid "Regardless of the time period,\nthere were always three precepts\nwithin the Shingon Tachikawa school:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625148"
msgid "\n\"Women must not lay with women.\"\n\"One must not reject enlightenment.\"\n\"One may not steal from one's master a tool of their craft.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625280"
msgid "\nThose whom break any of these rules\nare labeled heretics and are expelled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625356"
msgid "There was once a girl who was born as the\ndaughter of the head of a Vajrayana Buddhism sect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625452"
msgid "Her name was Kiara Sessyoin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625484"
msgid "As a young girl, her beauty was likened to a heavenly flower.\nAnyone who gazed upon her would fall in love at first sight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625608"
msgid "This is the Shingon Tachikawa Eiten school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625652"
msgid "It is a branch that splintered from the main school.\nThis proved fortunate, for it is the last surviving\nTachikawa school in this age where magical energy has depleted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625824"
msgid "The members of this sect had taken\nresidence deep in the mountains."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625892"
msgid "The girl was carefully groomed to become\nthe next sect head of this community."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625972"
msgid "The acolytes would whisper:\n\"Poor girl. As beautiful a flower as she may be,\nshe probably won't even live to fourteen.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626092"
msgid "All the acolytes ever did was lament outside her canopy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626152"
msgid "\nThis was not resentment; her conclusion was\nborderline enlightenment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626224"
msgid "That's the kind of creature humans are:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626264"
msgid "Could it be that―――this world no longer has\nany beings worthy of the name \"human\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626352"
msgid "Burying these thoughts within herself,\nthe girl awaited death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626416"
msgid "However, fate had not abandoned the girl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626460"
msgid "She had reached fourteen, her adolescence―and was on\nthe brink of death. An acolyte had suggested, in jest,\nthat she go experience Spiritron hacking.\nThrough that, she learned of the outside world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626660"
msgid "(How shortsighted of the girl's father to cut\nher off from the world and keep her from digital\nmeditation through the network!)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626788"
msgid "The girl's health quickly recovered as she learned of the\nvoluminous world of the electronic sea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626888"
msgid "What was a terminal illness within #RUBS  religious group#RUBEher world#REND\nwas actually a very much treatable disease.\nAll she had to do was step outside that world,\neven if just to go back-and-forth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627092"
msgid "The girl's abilities as a Spiritron Hacker flourished,\nand the Eiten school began to slowly transform."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627196"
msgid "She succeeded her conservative father\nand led the Tachikawa school towards its rightful,\nuntamed glory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627300"
msgid "…this must have been a fragment of #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's memories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627380"
msgid "As a young girl, she had never left her\nbed until she was fourteen.\nSilhouettes would assemble at a distance from her\ntent just to take peeks at her―and do nothing more.\nShe had been locked away, alive yet resigned\nto her fate to die in decay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627628"
msgid "…the vision that had etched itself into my mind fades away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627692"
msgid "―――Readying myself to witness another vision,\nI plunge into the mist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627768"
msgid "This corridor seems to exist within #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's memories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627840"
msgid "An individual's memories are always subjective,\nbut since #C236196003Kiara#CDEF has merged with the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nthe memories here take an objective perspective―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628024"
msgid "One day, the girl told this to her father.\nHe chided her as he chuckled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628100"
msgid "\n\n\"Hahaha. Become a Bodhisattva for what?\nSo you can then become a Tathāgata?\nOur Eiten school doesn't subscribe to the Ten Grave Precepts,\nbut we share the view that women cannot attain enlightenment.\nTo do so, there is a vow for women to seek to be reborn as men,\nbut it violates the first precept of the Tachikawa school.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628428"
msgid "She gracefully smiles back:\n\"You're right.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628472"
msgid "Her father was clueless as to his daughter's true motives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628532"
msgid "\n\n\n\n\"I want to bring salvation to the masses\npurely out of my own interests.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628612"
msgid "That vow meant everything to the girl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628652"
msgid "Early on, she came to accept that her personal\nvalues differed greatly from others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628736"
msgid "To sum her up, she was addicted to life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628780"
msgid "Despite being incapable of regarding the lives\nof others to be worth anything more than an\ninsect's, she could only feel joy from the\nlives of others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628932"
msgid "Virtuous lives, unscrupulous lives;\nbeautiful lives, foul lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629000"
msgid "Naturally, the richer the life, the richer the flavor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629056"
msgid "She was undoubtedly a Bodhisattva."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629092"
msgid "She made it her mission to become loved by legions of people.\nAll the while――reveling in the betrayal of those people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629216"
msgid "She saw vice.\nShe saw virtue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629248"
msgid "Yet, despite seeing these things,\nshe continued forgiving others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629316"
msgid "In her mind, she was the only one who was\n\"human.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629368"
msgid "Extortion, defamation, deceit, betrayal:\nall \"good deeds\" in her eyes, because they served\nto \"make her feel good.\" Even murder… though she never\nconsidered them \"human\" to begin with…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629556"
msgid "Far from a real Bodhisattva,\nshe possessed an evil repugnant to human sensibilities."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629644"
msgid "That's why her methods of seeking pleasure\nwere so corrupt―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629712"
msgid "Any person who proved \"bland\"―unable to stimulate her\nA-10 dopamine neurons no matter how she made\nthem suffer―was irredeemable; despicable;\na loathsome enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629876"
msgid "Which is why I want to bid you caution."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629916"
msgid "Never stand before this woman and purge your own desires.\nNever stand before this woman and deny life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630020"
msgid "If you have a wish, then wish for\na wonderful life; a beautiful life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630092"
msgid "…a chill runs up my spine, snapping me back to reality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630152"
msgid "That seemed to be #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's psyche:\nthe part of her that's terrifying.\nNow I understand just how disturbed she is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630292"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF doesn't recognize other people as \"human.\"\nOnly tools to serve in satisfying her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630396"
msgid "…people like that aren't even that rare.\nEvery human being has that side to them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630480"
msgid "What makes #C236196003Kiara#CDEF different isn't\nthat her nun appearance isn't an act."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630568"
msgid "She sincerely loves other people.\nDeeply and passionately."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630628"
msgid "When #C236196003Kiara#CDEF gives love, it takes course over but one day.\nThat love is so profound that it saves people from\nall suffering."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630768"
msgid "…that's what makes it so frightening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630808"
msgid "How could anyone possibly process that much love?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630860"
msgid "There is an exceptional power \"from the beyond\"\nwhich can make one from the union of two―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630952"
msgid "The Tachikawa Eiten's ultimate technique exists\nat the zenith of self control, reasoning, and ethics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631056"
msgid "One can destroy their human shell,\nbecome one with the deities,\nand on one's own reach harmony with the\nhighest universal principle―thus, achieving enlightenment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631220"
msgid "This is the teaching that the girl spread\nthroughout the digital world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631292"
msgid "Simultaneously, she was battling with her\nreligious group's policy against contact with the\noutside world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631400"
msgid "As if in prayer, she continued to teach\npeople throughout the internet,\nand from within her canopy, the acolytes as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631524"
msgid "She would do so kindly, patiently, and sincerely.\nHer dedication swayed the conservative seniority\nof the group as well as even her father.\nWithin two years, the group had transformed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631712"
msgid "Countless joined the group over the internet,\nbolstering the group's might to unprecedented levels."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631812"
msgid "Everyone believed in the Eiten school's new beginning.\nEveryone adored her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631888"
msgid "The only one within the group who felt uneasy\nwas the girl's father."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631960"
msgid "There were many new members, but many were leaving as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632020"
msgid "That was no problem. They're free to choose. But―――\nwhy does everyone who leaves end up dying?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632120"
msgid "They kept finding instances of suicide or disappearances\nwithin their mountain community… their little kingdom of a\nreligious group."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632256"
msgid "Three incidents in a year would've been a lot,\nbut this year alone there were already twenty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632352"
msgid "He couldn't shake off the suspicion budding within himself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632412"
msgid "The girl's father kept at a thorough\ninvestigation―until he finally found the cause."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632500"
msgid "\n\n―――Flesh piled on flesh. Like a heap of snakes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632556"
msgid "In the middle of the night, her father had\npeeked into his daughter's chamber.\nHer chamber had become a massive canopy,\nhousing dozens of acolytes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632704"
msgid "#RUBS  People#RUBEDesires#REND, #RUBS  people#RUBEdesires#REND, and #RUBS  people#RUBEdesires#REND wormed about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632820"
msgid "In the middle sat his daughter.\nThe acolytes swarmed her like ants."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632888"
msgid "The Eiten school had been accused of being an immoral school.\nSex conclaves do exist in various forms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632992"
msgid "However, his daughter's conclave fell under no known category.\nWhat is true is that every \"immoral school\" needs\na fittingly demonic banquet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633136"
msgid "…this ritual was no longer a union between two individuals.\nIt was a union between many. Or a union between the dead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633256"
msgid "By a lone, gorgeous priestess in white."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633296"
msgid "Everyone's selfishness surged into her alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633344"
msgid "Pretty as a flower, she smiled in the center of the\nscene―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633408"
msgid "Despite his dread, the father returned to his senses\nand pushed past the men and women until he reached\nhis daughter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633528"
msgid "He asked: \"Why?\"\nHis daughter replied: \"Because it feels good.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633592"
msgid "He asked again: \"Just for you?\"\nShe laughed: \"Just for me, so it's fine.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633668"
msgid "\"Father. People only need one thing―me.\n It's incorrect to think that a person should\n work with others to become one with Buddha.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633804"
msgid "\"A human needs only to seek pleasure.\n Ultimately, that opens the path to deliverance―――\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633900"
msgid "The voice of a manifested Bodhisattva\nechoed from the lust-steeped tent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633976"
msgid "The father couldn't comprehend\na single word his daughter was saying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634048"
msgid "\n\n\n\"I want to make the pleasures of many people into\n stepping stones.\n I want to serve as a vessel for many people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634168"
msgid "Indeed. It's quite obvious.\nI need only to take the form of what\nthe people believe in.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634260"
msgid "Basically, become a god."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634288"
msgid "His daughter announced that she wanted to become a god\nso that she could attain the ultimate pleasure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634392"
msgid "At the ripe age of seventy, he finally,\nfor the first time, awakened to a truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634476"
msgid "However, he was unable to move his arms, hands,\nor even a finger. His daughter's features were too pristine\nand too obscene."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634604"
msgid "His daughter looked down: \"No.\"\nHer father sidled close: \"Why?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634668"
msgid "His daughter kept shaking her head: \"No, no.\"\nHer father's eyes turned bloodshot: \"Isn't it too late?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634772"
msgid "\"My father is the one person who is out of the question.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634832"
msgid "\"You're so scrawny. You probably have no flavor to you.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634892"
msgid "In the end, the father did not kill his daughter.\nHe instead expelled her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634968"
msgid "The reason was simple: she violated two precepts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635020"
msgid "The exiled daughter apologized to her father and left.\nThe next day―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635096"
msgid "―――The next day, she finished up the rest of her business\nand left the religious group for good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635196"
msgid "The group no longer had any living members.\nDiscord within the ranks resulted in a mass slaughter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635296"
msgid "A total of sixty people, including the group's founder,\npassed away in a single night."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635384"
msgid "And thus, the sole surviving girl left\nthe place of her birth and upbringing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635464"
msgid "When she left, she took with her a tool\nher father used in ceremonies: a skull used for worship."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635564"
msgid "It is said that the Shingon Tachikawa school has\nthree precepts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635632"
msgid "And the final precept,\n\"One may not steal from one's master a tool of their craft.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635716"
msgid "The #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF underway over in the Near Side of the Moon\nand the events of the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF\nmay just be the same story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635884"
msgid "In one, a wise man had populated battlefields out of\nhis overconcern for mankind's future.\nIn the other, a saint seeks to destroy humanity\nout of an excessive pursuit of her own desires."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636072"
msgid "I can't tell which one of them is good and which one is evil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636136"
msgid "The Moon assigns equal values to certain things:\nsocial evils versus the individual's happiness.\nLofty wishes versus trifling wishes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636272"
msgid "―――I'm close to the Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636304"
msgid "I recall what my wish is.\nMy modest wish is to save not the world, but #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nSuch a future is unscryable.\nIt's far too small a wish to pit\nagainst that avatar of selfishness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636500"
msgid "…but I have no doubt in my mind.\nI know what I want."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "636556"
msgid "Continue to the next floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "636584"
msgid "Continue to the next floor."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "636612"
msgid "Keep pushing through the Corridor!\nThe Core is just up ahead!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "636676"
msgid "There's the entrance!\nWe're almost to the Core!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "636724"
msgid "Darling, we've finally reached the entrance!\nEscape this imaginary number space and reach the Core!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "636824"
msgid "So, we've finally arrived. Stay focused.\nThe one behind everything is lurking inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636912"
msgid "I felt an intense light for an instant.\nI reopen my eyes to find darkness all around me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637004"
msgid "This is the end of the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF…\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell's Central Region#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637116"
msgid "It's dark and cold, but I'm not scared. I feel lukewarm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637176"
msgid "I hear the echo of creaking that reminds me of a heartbeat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637236"
msgid "This isn't like the \"end of the Labyrinth\"\nthat we've seen many times before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637316"
msgid "This place has a similar structure to the Labyrinth,\nbut it's not the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF.\nIt's a \"#C000246204road to the Moon Cell's Core#CDEF\" made of Labyrinth parts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637500"
msgid "Lonely, isn't it? I expected our zenith path\nto be littered with roses…\nOh, well. I won't ask for much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637608"
msgid "Let's make haste, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND.\nNothing can surprise us at this point.\nWe'll simply press on, together!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637732"
msgid "…what an odd space. It feels like it stretches\non forever, yet it also feels like there's a\nwall in front of us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637848"
msgid "…it goes all the way to the end.\nLet's hurry, Master.\nWe don't have time to be standing around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637948"
msgid "Hm, this seems both familiar yet unfamiliar.\nThis smell has a mixture of death and life in\nit… This road is the kind that leads to hell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638088"
msgid "Which means, this may be that one path, right?\nIf memory serves, this is #RUBS    Yomotsu Hirasaka#RUBEthe Hirasaka#REND, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638216"
msgid "Hrrmm. My mother was the original yandere\nso I don't really want to go through here,\nbut we can't afford to wait around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638340"
msgid "Let's go, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND!\nThis straight path will be the last one we take!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638432"
msgid "It would seem this place is\na threshold between death and birth.\nIt reminds me of#RUBS            Kigal#RUBE the underworld#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638564"
msgid "This will also be my first time going to\nthe Core. There seems to be no danger, but this\nspace is like a cloth with frayed threads."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638696"
msgid "We don't have the luxury of dallying about.\nWe'll race through this road while there's\nstill a road to tread."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638808"
msgid "This is… the path that leads to the Core…\n#C236196003Andersen#CDEF must have sent me out of the Core and back here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638928"
msgid "I don't see #C236196003#SVT#CDEF anywhere.\nI guess #SVT[she][he][she][he]# ended up somewhere else…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639032"
msgid "I'll probably reach the Core again if I go down this path,\nbut how am I going to take on #C236196003Kiara#CDEF alone―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639156"
msgid "Can you hear me!?\nWait, first, are you alive!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639204"
msgid "A signal from #C236196003Rin#CDEF…!\nThe Student Council Room is in full operation, it seems!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639300"
msgid "We were only able to pick up your voices,\nbut we get that trouble went down in the Core!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639392"
msgid "We're tied up here so we need to make this\nquick: #C236196003Kiara#CDEF is accessing every\nsingle human on Earth right now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639516"
msgid "With an inversion of #C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF,\npeople's spirits are being drawn to HER.\nLooks like that's how she's getting energy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639668"
msgid "Which is why #C236196003Rani#CDEF and I are shutting things down\nfrom here! Every circuit we cut keeps getting\nreconnected, but it's better than nothing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639824"
msgid "We're doing everything in our power here!\nAs for the rest―――it'll have to be up\nto you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639940"
msgid "The rest is up to me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639964"
msgid "But #C236196003#SVT#CDEF isn't here.\nI'm not strong enough on my own―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640040"
msgid "What's got you so wishy-washy!?\nYou know who you want to save,\nand you know who the culprit is!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640136"
msgid "She's as feral as they come.\nI can't help but smile at how strong and optimistic she is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640228"
msgid "……that's right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640248"
msgid "Alright, I'm ending the transmission!\nWe're counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640312"
msgid "Once we wake up from this―――\nlet's meet again back in that\ngood old #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640416"
msgid "This time, I WILL save #C236196003Sakura#CDEF… no, both those two!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640484"
msgid "Which tells me that the Student Council\nRoom is in full operation!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640552"
msgid "Yes. We're under attack, but we can operate for\na few more minutes. We understand what happened\nin the Core based on our monitoring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640688"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF is still in the process of\ntransforming. She's also opened up a circuit\nto all intelligent lifeforms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640824"
msgid "It's an inversion of #C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF.\nPeople's spirits are being drawn into her\nand used as fuel for her distortion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640968"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and I are presently trying\nto obstruct the Core's access to Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641064"
msgid "It won't amount to much, but we want to\ndelay #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's transformation, even if\nit's just for a fraction of a second."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641208"
msgid "The rest is in my hands―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641240"
msgid "But #C236196003#SVT#CDEF isn't here.\nI'm not strong enough on my own―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641316"
msgid "You're not powerless. You saved #C236196003BB#CDEF. She was\nconsumed by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF and left to be\ndestroyed―but you saved her, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641476"
msgid "You gradually garnered strength over the course\nof your journey. Believe in that strength.\nYou won't lose to the likes of that woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641612"
msgid "Don't do this to help the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nor humanity; prevail for #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF―――\nFor us, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641776"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's uncharacteristic shouting snaps me back to reality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641852"
msgid "She said that she wants me to fight for #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and the others.\nNot for humanity or for #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641988"
msgid "…we're getting barraged even harder now.\nFurther communication will prove difficult."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642076"
msgid "May the stars bless you. No matter the hardship,\nno matter what darkness befalls you,\nthe North Star will light your way―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642204"
msgid "This time, I WILL save #C236196003Sakura#CDEF… no, both those two!"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "642272"
msgid "Beyond this point, there is no return."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "642312"
msgid "you save in a different location."
msgstr ""

